    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d510">

                <pb facs="0637" n="569" xml:id="pg569"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>Count Wydenhruck to Mr. Seward.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Oakland, Md.,</hi>
                        </placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1867-07-03"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >July</hi> 3, 1867</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Austrian court inquires telegraphically whether the American government has
                    the sad news of the archduke’s execution from any source of its own.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WYDERBUCK.</signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
